fixture dash_buffered_on_landing
doc BUILD.md s5 feel rules "Buffers are generous (8 f)"; docs/adr/0010: a dash pressed before landing starts on the landing frame, as a buffered jump does
room test/flat
spawn 400 400
frames 50
input
  # The air dash is spent at once; the second press, just before landing, waits in the buffer.
  0 R dash
  1..19 R
  20 R dash
  21..49 R
end
expect
  at 0 event.dash=1 air_dashes=0
  never 1..19 event.dash=1
  # The landing frame: the dash event and the dash state, as a ground dash on its frame 0; its
  # nine moving frames start on the next tick.
  mark land 20..30 event.land=1
  at land event.dash=1 state=dash dash_frame=0 dash_cooldown=24
  at land+1 dash_frame=1 vx=5120
end
